"you don't have permission to read this channel" "bu kanalı okuma izniniz yok"
"You don't have permission to reply in this thread." "Bu alt başlığa yanıt verme iznin yok."
"You don't have permission to send messages in this channel." "Bu kanala mesaj gönderme iznin yok."
"You have no favorite GIFs yet." "Henüz favori GIF'in yok."
"You haven't blocked anyone." "Kimseyi engellemedin."
"You joined a call" "Aramaya katıldın"
